# AI Projects API Tests
# =====================

### Login to get token
POST http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@aquariza.com",
  "password": "password"
}

### Get all projects
GET http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/projects
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Get single project by ID
GET http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/projects/1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Create a new project
POST http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/projects
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "title": "New Ocean Conservation AI",
  "description": "Using machine learning to monitor and protect coral reefs from environmental damage.",
  "status": "pending",
  "type": "Conservation",
  "progress": 10,
  "image_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1546026423-cc4642628d2b?q=80&w=1974&auto=format&fit=crop",
  "tags": ["Conservation", "Marine Life", "Computer Vision"]
}

### Update a project
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/projects/1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "progress": 75,
  "status": "active",
  "description": "Updated description with more details about the project scope and objectives."
}

### Delete a project
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/projects/1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
